      "title": "Chatterbox voice conversion",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": ["Re-voices existing speech into a persona's voice, keeping its words and timing.\n\nUsed for languages Chatterbox can't speak (e.g. Slovak): a native TTS voice (Piper) says the script, then this converts it to the persona's voice.\n\n- **Speech**: the audio to convert\n- **Target voice**: a 6-10 s clean clip of the persona\n- Closer pitch between the two gives clearer words (lower or raise the target clip to match)."],
      "widgets_values_named": {"text": "Re-voices existing speech into a persona's voice, keeping its words and timing.\n\nUsed for languages Chatterbox can't speak (e.g. Slovak): a native TTS voice (Piper) says the script, then this converts it to the persona's voice.\n\n- **Speech**: the audio to convert\n- **Target voice**: a 6-10 s clean clip of the persona\n- Closer pitch between the two gives clearer words (lower or raise the target clip to match)."},
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
